        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9163, Vintage Collection Oval Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design, this oval shaped knob is available in 3 vintage inspired finishes all of which mimic the texture of naturally weathered metal. This grants the Oval Vintage Finish Cabinet Knob an old world look that will add a pop of Victorian styling to any home. The Vintage Collection Oval Cabinet Knob is available in three sizes 1-3/16\", 1-3/8\" and 1-9/16\" Diameters.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available the <a href=\"/products/oval-cabinet-knob-omnia-9163\"><b>Omnia 9163 Oval Cabinet Knob</b></a> in other finishes and other <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Omnia Vintage Collection Cabinet Knobs</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 9163 Oval Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9163/30</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9163/35</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9163/40</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
